OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F381A1786967345
OL,3,CGrieving parents concerned as
OL,4,Cmaternity services told to improve
OL,5,Cagain
OL,7,FGrieving parents have told of their
OL,8,Fheartbreak that maternity services in
OL,9,FWest Sussex are receiving the same
OL,10,Frating from inspectors after concerns
OL,11,Fwere initially raised five years ago.
OL,13,FMaternity units at the Princess Royal
OL,14,FHospital in Haywards Heath and St
OL,15,FRichard's Hospital in Chichester were
OL,16,Fre-rated by watchdog the Care Quality
OL,17,FCommission last month as "requires
OL,18,Fimprovement" following an inspection
OL,19,Fbetween October and December last year.
OL,26,@yD@ZOUzD@LO]
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G1/19
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,382,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38102
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F381A1786967345
OL,3,CGrieving parents concerned as
OL,4,Cmaternity services told to improve
OL,5,Cagain
OL,7,FThe maternity services, run by
OL,8,FUniversity Hospitals Sussex NHS
OL,9,FFoundation Trust, were first given
OL,10,Fthat rating following a visit from the
OL,11,Fwatchdog in 2021.
OL,13,FKimberley Newark and Yann Trupiano
OL,14,Flost their baby girl Olivia in
OL,15,FSeptember 2024 at the trust and
OL,16,Fbelieve the lack of improved rating is
OL,17,F"really concerning".
OL,26,@yD@AOUyD@SO]
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G2/19
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,382,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38103
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F381A1786967345
OL,3,CGrieving parents concerned as
OL,4,Cmaternity services told to improve
OL,5,Cagain
OL,7,FMs Newark, 32, said: "We get told
OL,8,Fthings have been put in place, but
OL,9,Fit's not enough because it still
OL,10,Frequires improvement."
OL,12,F"It is really concerning, it's
OL,13,Fheartbreaking to hear," she said,
OL,14,Ffearing that "there's just going to be
OL,15,Fmore and more issues that arise".
OL,26,@oD@VOUrD@VO]tD@AOUuD@WO]vD@NOUwD@`O]
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G3/19
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,382,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38104
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F381A1786967345
OL,3,CGrieving parents concerned as
OL,4,Cmaternity services told to improve
OL,5,Cagain
OL,7,F"Obviously change doesn't happen
OL,8,Fovernight, especially in such a huge
OL,9,Ftrust, but you would have thought
OL,10,Fafter five years there would have been
OL,11,Fsome sort of change where the rating
OL,12,Fwould have gone up, and if not, why?"
OL,14,FMr Trupiano, 44, added he feels
OL,15,F"tired" of hearing improvements are
OL,16,Fneeded and the trust needs "walk the
OL,17,Ftalk".
OL,26,@oD@AOUtD@eO]wD@AOUwD@GO]xD@\OUyD@EO]
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G4/19
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,382,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38105
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F381A1786967345
OL,3,CGrieving parents concerned as
OL,4,Cmaternity services told to improve
OL,5,Cagain
OL,7,FMs Newark went to the Princess Royal
OL,8,FHospital in September 2024 with
OL,9,F"severe" pain but felt "dismissed" and
OL,10,Fshe was told it could have been
OL,11,Ftrapped wind.
OL,13,FThe mother had a suspected ruptured
OL,14,Fsplenic artery and an emergency c-
OL,15,Fsection was carried out on September
OL,16,F14.
OL,26,@qD@AOUqD@HO]qD@XOUqD@bO]
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G5/19
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,382,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38106
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F381A1786967345
OL,3,CGrieving parents concerned as
OL,4,Cmaternity services told to improve
OL,5,Cagain
OL,7,FOlivia was born with severe hypoxic
OL,8,Fischaemic encephalopathy, a critical
OL,9,Fbrain injury, and died several days
OL,10,Flater on September 19 at Royal Sussex
OL,11,FCounty Hospital in Brighton.
OL,13,FMs Newark said: "It ended in an awful
OL,14,Fsituation where I nearly lost my life,
OL,15,Fand our daughter did."
OL,17,FAn inquest looking at the
OL,18,Fcircumstances of her death is set to
OL,19,Fbe heard in October this year.
OL,26,@uD@QOUwD@VO]
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G6/19
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,382,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38107
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F381A1786967345
OL,3,CGrieving parents concerned as
OL,4,Cmaternity services told to improve
OL,5,Cagain
OL,7,FA trust spokesperson said they are
OL,8,F"desperately sorry" for the loss of
OL,9,FOlivia and findings of two reviews
OL,10,Finto her care have been shared with
OL,11,Ffamily who they met with to discuss
OL,12,Fconcerns, and are happy to meet again
OL,13,Fif the family wishes.
OL,15,FThey hope the inquest will give the
OL,16,Ffamily greater clarity and closure,
OL,17,Fand the trust will "do everything we
OL,18,Fcan to help the coroner address any
OL,19,Fremaining questions the family have".
OL,26,@pD@AOUpD@SO]yD@TOU{D@dO]
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G7/19
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,382,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38108
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F381A1786967345
OL,3,CGrieving parents concerned as
OL,4,Cmaternity services told to improve
OL,5,Cagain
OL,7,FIn the meantime the couple who live in
OL,8,FBrighton are urging for more education
OL,9,Faround situations like theirs and that
OL,10,Fparents are listened to.
OL,12,FMs Newark said: "I knew at that time,
OL,13,FI wasn't right. Something was wrong."I
OL,14,Fthink the main thing at the moment is
OL,15,Fto really listen to patients and
OL,16,Ffamilies."
OL,26,@tD@QOUuD@eOUxD@JO]
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G8/19
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,382,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38109
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F381A1786967345
OL,3,CGrieving parents concerned as
OL,4,Cmaternity services told to improve
OL,5,Cagain
OL,7,FIn the latest inspection of Princess
OL,8,FRoyal Hospital, inspectors rated the
OL,9,Fservice as requires improvement for
OL,10,Fbeing safe, well-led and responsive,
OL,11,Fand good for being effective and
OL,12,Fcaring. They found a previous legal
OL,13,Fbreach on staffing remained in that
OL,14,Fthe service "did not have enough staff
OL,15,Fto keep women safe".
OL,17,FStaff told inspectors they felt tired
OL,18,Fand burnt-out because of workforce
OL,19,Fpressures and demands on the service
OL,20,Fwhile shifts felt "increasingly
OL,21,Foverstretched".
OL,26,@vD@MOUwD@SO]|D@SOU}D@NO]
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G9/19
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,382,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38110
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F381A1786967345
OL,3,CGrieving parents concerned as
OL,4,Cmaternity services told to improve
OL,5,Cagain
OL,7,FCQC deputy director of hospitals and
OL,8,Fspecialist care in the south east
OL,9,FAmanda Williams said: "At Princess
OL,10,FRoyal Hospital, equipment failures
OL,11,Fregularly forced the maternity
OL,12,Foperating theatre to close, causing
OL,13,Fdelays to planned caesarean sections
OL,14,Fand increasing anxiety for women
OL,15,Fwaiting for treatment."/
OL,26,@qD@WOUwD@WO]wD@XPn
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}  G10/19
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,382,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38111
SC,0011
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F381A1786967345
OL,3,CGrieving parents concerned as
OL,4,Cmaternity services told to improve
OL,5,Cagain
OL,7,FInspectors, however, also received
OL,8,Ffeedback from women and partners who
OL,9,Fwere positive of the service, many
OL,10,Ffeeling they had been treated with
OL,11,Fdignity and respect through their
OL,12,Fcare.Of both hospital units, Ms
OL,13,FWilliams added: "Staff should be proud
OL,14,Fof the care they continue to provide
OL,15,Funder significant pressure and we will
OL,16,Fcontinue to monitor both services
OL,17,Fclosely to ensure women and their
OL,18,Fbabies remain safe while improvements
OL,19,Fare made."
OL,26,@uD@QOU{D@JO]
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}  G11/19
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,382,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38112
SC,0012
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F381A1786967345
OL,3,CGrieving parents concerned as
OL,4,Cmaternity services told to improve
OL,5,Cagain
OL,7,FBut of the CQC, Ms Newark said: "They
OL,8,Fshould be concerned by requires
OL,9,Fimprovement and the fact that it keeps
OL,10,Fcoming up. What's the point in doing
OL,11,Fthese reports and reviews if nothing's
OL,12,Fbeing done about it?"
OL,14,FThe re-ratings come as the Government
OL,15,Fhas announced a maternity review into
OL,16,FUniversity Hospitals Sussex NHS
OL,17,FFoundation Trust which will look at
OL,18,Fcases dating back to 2018, including
OL,19,Fall harmed and bereaved families.
OL,26,@oD@aOUtD@UO]
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}  G12/19
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,382,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38113
SC,0013
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F381A1786967345
OL,3,CGrieving parents concerned as
OL,4,Cmaternity services told to improve
OL,5,Cagain
OL,7,FSenior midwife and investigator Donna
OL,8,FOckenden will lead the opt-out review
OL,9,Fwhich is expected to look at more than
OL,10,F1,000 cases.
OL,12,FCampaign group Truth for Our Babies,
OL,13,Fmade up of affected families, had been
OL,14,Fcalling for the move, which Ms Newark
OL,15,Fand Mr Trupiano are part of.
OL,17,F"It's horrible to have to be a part of
OL,18,Fsuch a group, but it's nice to know we
OL,19,Faren't necessarily alone and we can
OL,20,Ftry and fight together," Ms Newark
OL,21,Fsaid.
OL,26,@yD@AOU|D@XO]
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}  G13/19
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,382,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38114
SC,0014
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F381A1786967345
OL,3,CGrieving parents concerned as
OL,4,Cmaternity services told to improve
OL,5,Cagain
OL,7,FMaternity negligence specialist at
OL,8,FTees Law Gwyneth Munjoma said the CQC
OL,9,Freport shows why the maternity review
OL,10,Fin Sussex is needed to "enforce real
OL,11,Faccountability and change".
OL,13,FUntil then she said this is an urgent
OL,14,Fpublic health issue which "demands
OL,15,Furgent intervention from the
OL,16,Findependent regulator now".
OL,26,@rD@XOUsD@ZO]vD@[OUxD@ZO]
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}  G14/19
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,382,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38115
SC,0015
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F381A1786967345
OL,3,CGrieving parents concerned as
OL,4,Cmaternity services told to improve
OL,5,Cagain
OL,7,FThe CQC said following its inspection,
OL,8,Fwhich found some progress was made but
OL,9,Fthe trust needed to do more, it asked
OL,10,Fleaders to submit an action plan on
OL,11,Fhow they will address specific issues.
OL,13,F"We have also made clear what
OL,14,Fregulatory action we will take if
OL,15,Fwe're not reassured by their plan," a
OL,16,Fspokesperson said.
OL,18,F"NHS hospital maternity services are
OL,19,Fsubject to close regulatory oversight.
OL,26,@uD@AOUwD@cO]zD@AOU
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}  G15/19
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,382,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38116
SC,0016
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F381A1786967345
OL,3,CGrieving parents concerned as
OL,4,Cmaternity services told to improve
OL,5,Cagain
OL,7,F"Where we have identified concerns
OL,8,Fabout the quality and safety of care,
OL,9,Fwe have held those trusts to account
OL,10,Fand required improvements to be made."
OL,12,FThey added they know there are
OL,13,Ffamilies who feel the watchdog has not
OL,14,Ftaken sufficient action to act on
OL,15,Ftheir concerns and they want to work
OL,16,Fwith them to help "amplify our calls
OL,17,Ffor greater efforts to strengthen
OL,18,Fmaternity safety across the board".
OL,26,@oD@AOUrD@fO]xD@SOUzD@bO]
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}  G16/19
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,382,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38117
SC,0017
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F381A1786967345
OL,3,CGrieving parents concerned as
OL,4,Cmaternity services told to improve
OL,5,Cagain
OL,7,FMeanwhile, the hospital trust has said
OL,8,Fit "absolutely accepts" the CQC's
OL,9,Fconclusion that further improvement is
OL,10,Fneeded and they are working hard to
OL,11,Faddress issues and improve care.
OL,13,FGail Byrne, interim chief nurse at the
OL,14,Ftrust, said: "We have increased
OL,15,Ftheatre capacity and staffing levels,
OL,16,Fstrengthened how we collect and
OL,17,Fmonitor key safety information, and
OL,18,Freviewed and updated policies and
OL,19,Fclinical guidance ` these changes all
OL,20,Frepresent progress, but we know this
OL,21,Fvital work must continue.
OL,26,@pD@DOUpD@WO]vD@NOU
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}  G17/19
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,382,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38118
SC,0018
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F381A1786967345
OL,3,CGrieving parents concerned as
OL,4,Cmaternity services told to improve
OL,5,Cagain
OL,7,F"We know there is more to do, for
OL,8,Feveryone using our services.
OL,10,F"Listening to women and families,
OL,11,Flearning from their experiences and
OL,12,Facting on what they tell us will
OL,13,Fremain at the heart of our commitment
OL,14,Fto providing safe, compassionate and
OL,15,Fhigh-quality care for every family."
OL,26,@oD@AOUrD@AOU
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}  G18/19
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,382,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38119
SC,0019
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F381A1786967345
OL,3,CGrieving parents concerned as
OL,4,Cmaternity services told to improve
OL,5,Cagain
OL,7,FShe added the trust welcomes the CQC's
OL,8,Frecognition of many improvements made
OL,9,Fin recent years, the maternity team's
OL,10,Fcompassion and dedication to their
OL,11,Fwork, and positive feedback from women
OL,12,Fand their loved ones.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}  G19/19
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
